{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1665.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"c14f5ca46d51f0503863c003d03c2a618230daefd5639a1d9198ac5a376ec407","ja":"……え？　だって、スタンドの裏からお札が……\nそうだ、まだ持って……あれっ！？　ない！？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1665.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"b1941d8a18be3af2dfb339d2447f48df3a5c2a73c4622097c78a55e537b2418f","ja":"や、やっぱり、なにかいるんだろか？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1665.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"a0727ee03319b4e368f3a391a69cae053d256b58736fad49f865f179ff075111","ja":"夜公演があるから、\nまだこの部屋にいないといけないのに……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
